      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DADDY COOL (3) continued his winning form with another strong run after running them ragged to make it two on end at this track over 400m (22.46). Winner at his latest appearance in the quickest time on the card. In sparkling form and looks the one to beat again. BUBBA RAY BANNER (1) goes very well this trip starting 15 times for five wins and four minors. Placed last time (19.79) at Traralgon in a Grade 4/5, finishing second and beaten 4 lengths. Can feature in the finish. HOKKAIDO EXPRESS (2) has a strong record this journey here with three wins and a minor from six starts. Was out of the placings last time (22.62) at Shepparton in a Free For All, finishing seventh and beaten 6 lengths. Looks suited here and can measure up. GALLOPING HAPPY (8) can improve on an unplaced run here last time out.",
